      "title": "Read me: models & settings",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Models\n\n**Transformer** (~10.3 GB) → `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/`\n[kandinsky_imagesr_2.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/hmdlsk/Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0-ComfyUI/blob/main/kandinsky_imagesr_2.0.safetensors)\n\n**VAE** (335 MB) → `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\nFLUX.1 `ae.safetensors` from [black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-schnell](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-schnell) (Gated: Accept the terms once on HF.)\n\n## Settings\n\n- **upscale_factor**: 2 or 4\n- **creativity**: 0–8, default 4. Lower for text and line art. Higher for more invented details.\n- **weight_dtype** `fp8_e4m3fn` saves ~4 GB VRAM, not time. If VRAM isn't an issue, use Default.\n\nMore: [github.com/the-aSak/ComfyUI-KSR-Unofficial](https://github.com/the-aSak/ComfyUI-KSR-Unofficial)\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Models\n\n**Transformer** (~10.3 GB) → `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/`\n[kandinsky_imagesr_2.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/hmdlsk/Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0-ComfyUI/blob/main/kandinsky_imagesr_2.0.safetensors)\n\n**VAE** (335 MB) → `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\nFLUX.1 `ae.safetensors` from [black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-schnell](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-schnell) (Gated: Accept the terms once on HF.)\n\n## Settings\n\n- **upscale_factor**: 2 or 4\n- **creativity**: 0–8, default 4. Lower for text and line art. Higher for more invented details.\n- **weight_dtype** `fp8_e4m3fn` saves ~4 GB VRAM, not time. If VRAM isn't an issue, use Default.\n\nMore: [github.com/the-aSak/ComfyUI-KSR-Unofficial](https://github.com/the-aSak/ComfyUI-KSR-Unofficial)\n"
      },
